# No one left behind (bus boarding)

**Locked 2026-09-03.** Spec: GUARDRAILS §11.10 / §12.4.3.

## Bus boarding (every run)

Anyone **on that bus** must appear on the boarding / head-count list until they are **on the bus** or **not travelling** (same Skip / not-travelling path as a participant).

Includes participants, staff, volunteers, and carers. Day Centre morning/afternoon, event Transport IN / HOME, and **every multi-day venue hop**.

Do **not** filter boarding to `toParticipantId` / `participant_id` only.

```ts
// ❌ BAD — staff/volunteer/carer vanish from the head count
legs.filter((l) => l.toParticipantId != null)

// ✅ GOOD — same person test as isPassengerPickupLeg / event_bus_manifest
leg.toParticipantId ?? leg.toStaffId ?? leg.toCarerId
```

Off the bus only when explicitly **not travelling** (or cancelled pickup / Left trip) — not because of role.

## Not boarding — overnight / floor rolls

**Morning roll, evening/curfew roll, meal, meds:** participants (clients) only. Do not add staff/volunteers/carers to those rolls to “match” boarding.

Support people still have their own **floor check-in** and **own Manifest stop** when they travel. That is not overnight roll call.
